## Formatting

Run `<%= getPackageManagerRunScript('format') %>` to format files and
`<%= getPackageManagerRunScript('check') %>` to check formatting without changing them.

Oxfmt is configured in `.oxfmtrc.json`. This toolchain does not add a linter.
Oxfmt requires Node 20.19 or newer on the Node 20 line, or Node 22.12 or newer.
